# MOFs-derived dodecahedra porous Co 3 O 4 : An efficient cataluminescence sensing material for H 2 S

MOFs-derived dodecahedra porous $\mathrm{Co}_{3}\mathrm{O}_{4}$ :  An efficient cataluminescence sensing material for $\mathsf{H}_{2}\mathsf{S}$
